      "title": "Home | Mertens Lab | UCSD",
      "headings": [
        "Neural Aging Laboratory",
        "Department of Neurosciences University of California San Diego"
      ],
      "text": "Neural Aging Laboratory Department of Neurosciences University of California San Diego To understand how aging influences brain health and disease, our lab uses cellular reprogramming technologies to develop the next generation of human aging models. ​ We aim to use these models to identify the key molecules driving human aging, ultimately informing new treatment strategies for age-related neurodegenerative diseases. A ging is the primary risk factor for neurodegenerative diseases like Alzheimer’s and Parkinson’s",
